Subject: [PATCH] mmap: include stdint.h for uint16_t

DynamicMMap::WriteString uses uint16_t. Include its defining header
directly instead of relying on transitive includes from the C++ library,
which no longer provide it with newer host compilers.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/apt-pkg/contrib/mmap.cc
+++ b/apt-pkg/contrib/mmap.cc
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@
 #include <cstring>
 #include <string>
 #include <errno.h>
+#include <stdint.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <unistd.h>
 
